<title>USA: Osicom sees more than $35 mln in Q3 rev.</title>
<headline>Osicom sees more than $35 mln in Q3 rev.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA MONICA, Calif. 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Osicom Technologies Inc said Saturday that it expected third-quarter revenue to be more than $35 million.</p>
<p>The company in a statement also said it did not expect to record an acquisition-related charge in the third quarter from the purchase of Builders Warehouse Association Inc.</p>
<p>In the last fiscal year, Osicom posted third-quarter revenues of $2.7 million.</p>
</text>
